<title>HUNGARY: Balaton Fuszert to seek delisting.</title>
<headline>Balaton Fuszert to seek delisting.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian trading company Balaton Fuszert Rt said on Monday it was considering to delist its stocks from the Budapest Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company will seek shareholders' approval for the delisting at its annual shareholders meeting on May 29.</p>
<p>Balaton Fuszert, which was not immediately available for further comment, is 50 percent plus one share owned by a consortium led by trading group Csopak Szovetkezeti Rt .</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
